id: pm-pz49xc
title: CLI transport-floor RSS admission false-fails on single-sample page noise
description: "Two tracked CI=1 pnpm quality:static runs on unchanged source passed every functional and governance assertion but failed the final CLI transport-floor RSS check on different operation sets by only 23 KiB to 398 KiB. The benchmark discards one warm-up and measures three fresh processes, yet admission uses the maximum RSS sample, so one page-level outlier hard-fails while latency correctly admits a stable statistic plus noise margin. Preserve unchanged committed budgets and maximum-RSS diagnostics, but admit median measured RSS so one noisy process cannot fail and a majority persistent increase still does."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags: []
created_at: "2026-08-28T01:06:15.788Z"
updated_at: "2026-08-28T03:21:31.929Z"
closed_at: "2026-08-28T03:21:31.222Z"
completed_at: "2026-08-28T03:21:31.222Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 90
acceptance_criteria: "CLI transport report retains maximum RSS as diagnostic evidence and adds an explicit median RSS admission value over the measured processes; committed RSS budgets are unchanged; comparison uses the median plus a fixed 512 KiB measurement-noise margin; one high outlier and page-level linked-harness variance pass; a persistent median above the budget plus margin fails; missing RSS remains fail-closed when a budget requires it; docs explain the policy; focused tests, live gate, linked receipts, and exact repository coverage pass at 100/100/100/100."
parent: pm-yse5dt
risk: low
confidence: high
severity: low
repro_steps: "Run CI=1 pnpm quality:static through a tracker-context linked test on unchanged source; observe different operations exceed max_peak_rss_bytes by less than 0.3 percent while an earlier standalone run passes."
resolution: "CLI transport-floor RSS admission now uses the three-process median plus a fixed 512 KiB measurement-noise allowance against unchanged committed budgets, retains maximum RSS diagnostics, and fails closed on missing measurements or persistent regressions beyond the bound."
expected_result: One isolated RSS sample cannot fail the transport floor; a persistent majority RSS increase still fails against the unchanged budget.
actual_result: "Focused and live gates plus the terminal 4/4 linked-test run pass; full coverage remains exact 100/100/100/100 across 585 files and 8076 tests, and CI=1 static quality passes with the transport floor included."
fixed_version: 2026.8.28
component: CLI transport performance gate
